course: dictionary
lesson: 7449
title: Pong: a smell, a game, or a ping
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the words around them tell you which one is meant. Pong is one of these words. Read the clues first, then choose the meaning that fits.
explain: «Your trainers pong!» is a jokey way to say something smells very bad. Trainers are shoes, so the sentence is about a smell, not a sound. To pong means to smell bad, and pongy is the adjective for something smelly.
explain: «Pong, from 1972, was one of the first popular video games» has a capital P and the word game is a clue. This is a different word with a different meaning. In «ping-pong», the word means table tennis. Always check the clues before you choose a meaning.
fact: A pong is a strong, unpleasant smell. This use is informal, mostly in the UK, Australia and New Zealand.
fact: To pong means to smell bad, and pongy is the adjective: «The gym bag was pongy.»
fact: Pong, with a capital P, is one of the first video games. It was a simple game with two bats and a ball.
fact: «Pong, from Atari in 1972, was the first big hit arcade game.»
fact: Ping-pong is another name for table tennis.
exercise: «Your trainers pong!» What does pong mean here? | They are new and shiny | *It smells really bad | It is making a loud noise | It is raining
exercise: «Pong, from 1972, was one of the first popular video games.» What is Pong in this sentence? | A strong smell | Table tennis | *A video game | A type of shoe
exercise: In PE, ping-pong is another name for which game? | Football | *Table tennis | Netball | Rounders
test: The gym bag was so ___ that we opened the window. Which word fits? | Shiny | *Pongy | Wobbly | Sleepy
test: The kitchen bin began to pong after a week. What does pong mean? | Shine brightly | Go very slowly | Make a loud bang | *Smell strongly and unpleasantly
exam: Which sentence uses pong as a verb (an action word)? | *Those old socks really pong | We hit the ball across the table | The pong from the bin filled the room | We played Pong on the old computer
